na and Gideon's son, swings his legs on a chair too tall.", "para": 1, "sent": 5, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Jolene offers a coffee to Fiona.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Fiona doesn't take it.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Hana takes it instead.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Jolene smiles and sits.", "para": 2, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Thanks.", "name": "HANA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You're welcome.", "name": "JOLENE", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Fiona stares at the ficus.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Gideon taps his screen.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Ivo clears his throat.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Gideon.", "name": "IVO", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Dad.", "name": "GIDEON", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Put the phone away.", "name": "IVO", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's work.", "name": "GIDEON", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's never work.", "name": "FIONA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Fiona, not here.", "name": "GIDEON", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["not looking up"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Where, then?", "name": "FIONA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "In there. With the lawyer.", "name": "GIDEON", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mom, can I have a coffee?", "name": "KASPAR", "speaker": 5, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No.", "name": "FIONA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'll get you a hot chocolate, sweetheart.", "name": "JOLENE", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": ["to Kaspar"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Don't call him that.", "name": "FIONA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm sorry?", "name": "JOLENE", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Sweetheart.", "name": "FIONA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Hana stands.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Fiona stands.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Jolene stands.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Gideon rises last.", "para": 4, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Ivo folds his arms.", "para": 4, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Kaspar slides off the chair, backs into the corner, and the five adults square off, voices rising, hands moving, until the door opens and a receptionist leans out.", "para": 4, "sent": 5, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Everyone freezes.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Sorry.", "name": "HANA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["quietly"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "She sits.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "They all sit.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Kaspar slips back into his chair.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Fiona accepts the coffee, finally.", "para": 6, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}]}